Z||000015||GT Bastard||04-28-2000||05:10 PM||||A lot of it's going to depenend on the gears he's running, and the condition of his motor.  My old TPI Iroc was pretty dead, but I've ridden in other TPI 305's with healthy engines and a couple basic mods, and they can be reasonably quick.||||reg||1
